    },
    {
      "id": "2j7ft5RSXGtCai-xdkPni",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 303.4086388700805,
      "y": 564.677481679905,
      "width": 845.0985010330277,
      "height": 80,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ah",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1658406878,
      "version": 879,
      "versionNonce": 2010557780,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1758523559220,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "App developers decide how to route requests based on the path and header.\n\nBecause an API Gateway cannot infer the mapping between requests and backend services, multiple\nRouteRules are required to explicitly define these mappings.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "App developers decide how to route requests based on the path and header.\n\nBecause an API Gateway cannot infer the mapping between requests and backend services, multiple RouteRules are required to explicitly define these mappings.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "gQPFXfTLsbT3-GwPxr8Gb",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 309.3862732814291,
      "y": 1071.5220583673379,
      "width": 848.7734375000001,
      "height": 80,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ai",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1490655326,
      "version": 880,
      "versionNonce": 553677140,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1758523413432,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Agents (with optional user input) decide which tool to invoke based on the conversation. \n\nSince the MCP Gateway can retrieve the mapping between tools and backend services by calling\ntools/list, multiple RouteRules are not required to define this mapping explicitly.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Agents (with optional user input) decide which tool to invoke based on the conversation. \n\nSince the MCP Gateway can retrieve the mapping between tools and backend services by calling tools/list, multiple RouteRules are not required to define this mapping explicitly.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
